  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_01",
      "hash64": "4A63BD332C8423A6",
      "text": "Oooh ho ho ho !\\nOooh ho ho ho ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_02",
      "hash64": "4A63BC332C8421F3",
      "text": "Milio, regarde-moi cela !\\nCe petit jardinet est un délice pour les yeux ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_01",
      "hash64": "2F7DE3952507E0F8",
      "text": "Il s’agit en fait d’un verger, ma chère Naire !\\c\\nMême si, pour toi, je comprends que cela puisse\\nsembler petit ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_03",
      "hash64": "4A63BB332C842040",
      "text": "C’est une plaisanterie...\\nÇa, un verger ?!\\r\\nUne version miniature, à la limite ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_04",
      "hash64": "4A63C2332C842C25",
      "text": "Ah, mon cher Milio ! Heureusement, tu es là\\npour me reprendre-han ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_02",
      "hash64": "2F7DE6952507E611",
      "text": "C’est bien normal ! Les mœurs des gens modestes\\nsont parfois mystérieuses pour moi aussi ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_05",
      "hash64": "4A63C1332C842A72",
      "text": "Aaah, les impécunieux... Leurs habitudes sont\\ninsaisissables et pourtant fascinantes...\\c\\nParfois, j’y pense tellement que j’en perds\\nle sommeil ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_06",
      "hash64": "4A63C0332C8428BF",
      "text": "Qui voilà... ?\\nOh, mais il s’agit de notre plébéien[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0200)]ne préféré[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0200"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_03",
      "hash64": "2F7DE5952507E45E",
      "text": "Pas d’erreur possible : c’est encore [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0403)]luielle ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0403"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_07",
      "hash64": "4A63BF332C84270C",
      "text": "Vois-tu, je veux en savoir plus sur les personnes\\ndans le besoin ! Me sentir plus proche d’elles ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_08",
      "hash64": "4A63C6332C8432F1",
      "text": "Pour cela... nous devrions nous affronter\\nà nouveau. Qu’en dis-tu ?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_04",
      "hash64": "2F7DE8952507E977",
      "text": "Ouah ! Naire, tu es tellement intelligente !\\nApprendre à connaître quelqu’un en l’affrontant,\\r\\nc’est si bien pensé ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_09",
      "hash64": "4A63C5332C84313E",
      "text": "Ho ho ho... Viens donc me voir quand tu seras\\nprêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à te battre-han.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_npc",
      "hash64": "C7A9B36FA70B1822",
      "text": "Tu as l’occasion unique d’affronter à nouveau\\nla grande Naire. Va donc t’adresser à elle ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_10",
      "hash64": "4A60B8332C81E550",
      "text": "La politesse m’oblige à te demander :\\nacceptes-tu ce duel ?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_11",
      "hash64": "4A60B9332C81E703",
      "text": "Quelle drôle d’idée de dire non aux grands\\nde ce monde...\\c\\nJe t’ai déjà dit que le temps c’est de l’argent.\\nJe vais donc m’occuper de toi sans tarder ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_12",
      "hash64": "4A60BA332C81E8B6",
      "text": "À la bonne heure ! Cette fois, je vais te ratatiner,\\net je l’annoncerai sur tous les réseaux sociaux ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_05",
      "hash64": "2F7DE7952507E7C4",
      "text": "Allez ! Allez ! Tu es la meilleure, Naire ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_13",
      "hash64": "4A60BB332C81EA69",
      "text": "Quoi ? J’ai perdu par deux fois ?\\nMais qui es-tu réellement ?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_14",
      "hash64": "4A60BC332C81EC1C",
      "text": "Dis-moi, Milio !\\nLes défavorisés sont-ils tous aussi doués pour\\r\\nles combats Pokémon que ce[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0300)]tte jeune [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]hofemme ?![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0300"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_06",
      "hash64": "2F7DEA952507ECDD",
      "text": "Je crois bien que ce[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0300)]tte prolétaire possède\\nune particularité dont seuls quelques élus\\r\\ndu peuple sont dotés...[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0300"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_07",
      "hash64": "2F7DE9952507EB2A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0402)]IlElle a... de l’ambition ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0402"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_15",
      "hash64": "4A60BD332C81EDCF",
      "text": "De l’ambition-han ?! Pour les combats Pokémon ?\\nPourquoi pas, après tout... ?\\c\\nPersonnellement, j’ai préféré utiliser la mienne\\npour bâtir un empire immobilier.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_16",
      "hash64": "4A60BE332C81EF82",
      "text": "Cela étant, je comprends mieux pourquoi j’ai\\nperdu. Je dirais même que ça coule de source...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_17",
      "hash64": "4A60BF332C81F135",
      "text": "... En parlant de source, j’ai bien envie d’admirer\\nle bord de l’eau...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_18",
      "hash64": "4A60C0332C81F2E8",
      "text": "Trêve de bavardages-han !\\c\\nMilio, emmène-moi immédiatement au bord\\nde la plus [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]grande étendue d’eau[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] de Paldea ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_08",
      "hash64": "2F7DDC952507D513",
      "text": "À tes ordres !\\c\\nQuand une envie te prend, elle ne saurait\\nattendre ! Cela prouve bien que tu es\\r\\nla parfaite influenceuse, Naire ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_09",
      "hash64": "2F7DDB952507D360",
      "text": "Je sais ce qui te ferait du bien, après cet épuisant\\ncombat : te reposer au bord de l’eau sur un îlot ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_secretary_01",
      "hash64": "4A3450DFFC4B52BA",
      "text": "Madame Naire et monsieur Milio sont partis\\nvoir le verger de Septentria.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
